    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "99.8% is a strong number. Just to be safe, I want to drill down on the telemetry itself. Are we 100% sure that the tools generating these reports aren't themselves compromised or prone to blind spots? If an attacker actually found a way to bypass the scanner, would our current monitoring actually catch the anomaly, or are we just seeing what the tools tell us to see?",
